  shortDescription: Serpentine channels full of ash drifts and the skeletons of surface
    life.
  isPlaceholder: 0
  visitPurpose: Early exploration biome. Come here to learn routes, gather basics,
    and work around bowls, pools, and local hotspots.
  commonRewardHook: Common runs pay out in Sulfur Clumps and Thermal Gel.
  rareRewardHook: 'Rare pull is modest: Tungsten Chunk and Cooling Cartridge.'
  landmarkIdentity: Meander-Basins reads through bowls, pools, domes, and hotspot
    basins. Landmarks should feel bright and readable.
  safePocketIdentity: Safe pockets are frequent. The player should often see a clear
    reset point nearby.
  riskSummary: 'Main failure mode: localized danger pockets and hostile basins. Creature
    pressure stays high.'
  extractionFocus: 'Quick strike extraction from hot pockets with short exposure
    windows. Early tier: keep runs short and expect basin pockets, salvage traps,
    and local hotspots.'
  landmarkGuidance: Dominant landmark is heat vent field or obsidian flow edge. This
    slot should read through glass lip, vent mouth, or hot crack; use bowls and hotspot
    rims to remember loops.
